   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Promise Kazakhstan &#x2013; From Pledge to Impact II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brief DescriptionThe project has been initiated as a response to the countrys request for NDC Partnership. This project aims to enhance Kazakhstan&#x2019;s Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC) 3.0 by integrating robust adaptation, loss and damage, and financing strategies. It focuses on strengthening institutional frameworks, mobilizing resources, and ensuring effective implementation through a comprehensive and inclusive approach.</narrative>
  </description>
